<section class="about">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="about-card">
    <div class="about-info">
      <p>My name is Maise and i'm the stylist behind A'MAISE and part of the COMU community.</p>
      <p>
        My passion for hair started during my hairdressing education, where I quickly realized that working with curls and textured hair was what truly inspired me. I felt like there was a lack of spaces where there was time to really understand both
        the hair and the person behind it — not just focus on speed and standard treatments. That’s why I created A’MAISE.
      </p>
      <p class="hidden">
        At A’MAISE, it’s not just about hair. It’s about feeling safe, welcomed, and understood. Many of my clients come from previous salon experiences where they didn’t feel heard or where their hair type wasn’t properly understood. Creating a
        space built around trust, good energy, and genuine connection is therefore one of the most important parts of what I do.
      </p>
    </div>
    <img src="/imgs/stock-img.png" alt="Photo of Maise, founder of A'MAISE" class="about-img" />
  </div>
</section>
